nstitution, go style constitution, task description, constraints, shared protocols, and package contracts. This is an automated stitch task from the cobbler orchestrator.\n   - Second message: \"CRITICAL: Respond with TEXT ONLY. Do NOT call any tools.\" - Requesting a detailed summary of the conversation.\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Create `cmd/pr/main.go` implementing srd110-pr requirements R3.1, R4.1, R4.2, R4.3 (plus foundational R1, R2, R5)\n   - Verify compilation with `go build -o bin/pr ./cmd/pr/`\n   - Verify with `go vet ./cmd/pr/`\n   - Ensure all acceptance criteria AC1-AC6 are met\n\n8. Current Work:\n   I had just finished reading all four required reference files (srd110-pr.yaml, rel15.0-uc003-pr.yaml, cmd/nl/main.go, cmd/fmt/main.go) and was about to begin planning and implementing the `cmd/pr/main.go` file. No code has been written yet.\n\n   The implementation needs to create a GNU pr-compatible utility with:\n   - Page layout: 66-line pages with 5-line header (date, filename, page number), 56-line body, 5-line footer\n   - Page options: -l (length), -h (header text), -t (omit header/footer), -T (omit pagination)\n   - Multi-column: -COLUMN/--columns=COLUMN with fill-down default, -a for fill-across\n   - Line numbering: -n[CHAR[WIDTH]] with defaults tab/5\n   - Indentation: -o MARGIN, -w WIDTH (default 72)\n   - Double-space: -d flag\n   - Column separator: -s CHAR (default tab)\n   - File input from args or stdin (\"-\")\n   - Exit 0 on success, 1 on error\n   - SIGPIPE handling via sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler()\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Write the complete `cmd/pr/main.go` file following the patterns from cmd/nl/main.go and cmd/fmt/main.go, implementing all SRD requirements (R1-R5, with focus on R3.1, R4.1, R4.2, R4.3 as specified in the task). Then verify compilation with `go build -o bin/pr ./cmd/pr/` and `go vet ./cmd/pr/`.\n\n   The task description states: \"Implement srd110-pr requirement R3.1 as specified in the SRD\", \"Implement srd110-pr requirement R4.1 as specified in the SRD\", \"Implement srd110-pr requirement R4.2 as specified in the SRD\", \"Implement srd110-pr requirement R4.3 as specified in the SRD\" with design decisions including \"Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main()\" and \"The binary must be buildable with go build -o bin/pr ./cmd/pr/\".\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/pdiddy/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-dl-cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn-T-go-unix-utils-worktrees-5659/bcc96e82-fad5-44af-be06-67ed4832116e.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bcc96e82-fad5-44af-be06-67ed4832116e","uuid":"fa72bd6e-4be8-480b-b24c-df8449a775f3","timestamp":"2026-05-29T17:50:58.972Z","isSynthetic":true}
